# escape_shade_mathair -- the antechamber: the mother, one of the dead waiting at the well
#
# PLACEHOLDERS. A woman who wants to see her child grown, just once.
# Before Géaga looks away, they are waiting as you are; after, they have seen her let you go.

@file underworld/escape
@encounter 10

= node 0 — waiting
@when !note escape_geaga_blind_eye
[PLACEHOLDER] (A woman who wants to see her child grown, just once.) Waiting, as you are, to ask her.
% [Gaeilge le teacht]

= node 1 — she let you go
@when note escape_geaga_blind_eye
[PLACEHOLDER] She let you go? (Wonder, envy, a message for the living.)
% [Gaeilge le teacht]
